<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-10-30T02:04:16.364Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:04:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Manipur seized weapons caches, brown sugar and arrested two NRFM cadres while reviewing a 48‑hour shutdown after two Kuki-Zo youths went missing and the Naga community was accused of abduction. In Kashmir, a woman was killed and three injured when a tempo rolled down a road in Reasi, and a man was injured in a bear attack in South Kashmir, while the Army commander reviewed security preparedness along the LoC in Poonch and Rajouri. The Assam Rifles chief inspected border fencing and joint grids in Moreh on the India-Myanmar frontier. Former Maoist commanders married in Hazaribagh open jail as police intervened. 437 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/india-increases-growth-forecast-for-fiscal-year/a-79798971?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPZWoySzJPakJoQTlMQUhLRDA0d3RFNGFFb2pzZkVLVDJCSmxwbmxoSl8wd1VuMll5cjdER2ZYVEhhQ2Y0OXN2NG5SWG9kdjU0UWY4WERnd2VIZVJrWTRYNHdIYWZaUlA3emlaOGY1dElhVlJyYXVEcFBMLVdJWjJnTDA5VUYxSWVlcHdCSjVzTWdPX1JYbGNMNFR1YU1YOVE4djFhMzZEbEhBcmtJRm9zZXBySmR4bVh40gG-AUFVX3lxTFBrMzRsMzNWQWUxemgxNzVTU2tRNGVjVmJCY19jR0kxbUxKV3VVRUNyRDUxeHZzUG5mNmkwNnJIQm56T3BVZ2YydTNCVkpTemJKMXo3RFZZOWdUNHg5dHNhMVl4OG5hTmoxeFU0aEJWbjBkRk9laUhpUkcyUjhjOG92Z0d5cFBOMW1ybjRvdjgyRE9TTXk2UlhrYUlORnVtSEFXd0JEa3BvcnpuYm5RbXNQV2FwcDZ1MWxKamQzcEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hindustan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Greater Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE5Sb0JieWRKRGdTRE1Ed2JNbm54ajRjd21UalBoaFE3VW5ja3UtdnNWZVNQZ1BIeVpweTJvcjVGQmczY2lYOWw1QlhKdTJ2cDczcG9peWRHV0cwajExeE9JcWg3c0E5Q1Q2?oc=5&